  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place water and salt in a medium saucepan, cover, and bring to a boil over high heat."
    },
    {
      "text": "Once boiling, stir in oats, honey, and cardamom. Cover and let simmer, on low, 3-5 minutes, or until oats reach desired consistency."
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, wash, dry, and peel oranges; separate into segments and roughly chop the flesh."
    },
    {
      "text": "Roughly chop dates."
    },
    {
      "text": "When the oatmeal is done, add tahini to the saucepan and stir to combine. Remove from heat."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, divide oatmeal between bowls; top with oranges, dates, and sesame seeds. Drizzle with honey and enjoy!"
    }
  ]
